Subject: Urgent water intrusion in Suite 4B

Elaine,

We arrived this morning to active water intrusion above the conference room in Suite 4B. The leak is near the router cabinet and storage closet where client files are kept. Please treat this as urgent. We need building maintenance today and written confirmation that Meridian received this notice.

Marcus Chen

EMAIL 2
